6. Provenance Guarantees

Every snapshot is cryptographically signed.

Every signature is chained to the previous.

Every simulation run is self‑verifying.

Every artifact has tamper‑proof lineage.

7. Error Codes

400 — Invalid geometry parameters  
401 — Invalid shear key  
404 — Snapshot not found  
409 — Provenance chain mismatch  
500 — MRI solver failure  

8. Versioning

Semantic versioning:

v1.x — stable  
v2.x — experimental geometry modules  
v3.x — exotic‑matter extended transforms  

